1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC,
"Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,280
It's said that...

4
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,880
an average person...

5
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,680
passes by 1,000 people a day.

6
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,160
Amidst the hustle and bustle,

7
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,320
we can never predict...

8
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,080
when, where,

9
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,480
and with whom...
we will meet again.

10
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,480
It could be a long-lost colleague,

11
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,480
or it could be...

12
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,440
our former selves.

13
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:38,120
(Episode 2:
Fate Is Like an Illusion)

14
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:54,800
(The Making of a Model Female Pilot,
Today's Takeoff Into the Skies)

15
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:10,120
While introducing the new model,

16
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:11,960
we need to find an answer.

17
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,160
An answer that can...

18
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,680
save Hengshi Air at its roots.

19
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,400
Go to Qingdao right away.

20
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,640
I'm giving you authority
over personnel matters.

21
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,080
No matter the terms,

22
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,160
you must sign this student.

23
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,240
You must succeed.
Failure is not an option.

24
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,560
Yes, Mr. Fu.

25
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,040
I know...

26
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,240
there must be many airlines
looking to recruit you lately.

27
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,680
You can name
your own relocation allowance.

28
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:45,720
Of course,

29
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:48,600
that includes any conditions
you can think of right now.

30
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,240
Feel free to ask for anything.

31
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,440
I'll take the contract for now.

32
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,360
I'll think about it
for a few days...

33
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,480
before giving you
an answer, Mr. Yan.

34
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,840
No problem.

35
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,440
As long as it's not a rejection,

36
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,240
I'll wait for you...

37
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,960
until the end of time.

38
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,160
But then again,

39
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,839
for a student pilot...

40
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,440
to obtain a commercial license,

41
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,560
they must endure many hardships.

42
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,920
It's a grueling test...

43
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,280
even for a man.

44
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,840
Let alone...

45
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:20,640
for a beautiful woman like you.

46
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,200
Ms. Ruan, I'm truly impressed.

47
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,080
Not only did you graduate smoothly,

48
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,720
but you also managed to rank first
in every single assessment.

49
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,240
It's simply a miracle.

50
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,520
For a pilot,

51
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,720
there's no such thing
as "first place".

52
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,720
Mr. Yan, you flatter me too much.

53
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,760
Is that so?

54
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,320
Your captain and your instructor...

55
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:42,800
both introduced you to me that way.

56
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,360
In their hearts, you are number one.

57
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:48,560
But you're not in mine.

58
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,000
In my heart,

59
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,520
you are...

60
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,920
the only one.

61
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,480
I'm sorry, Ms. Ruan.

62
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:02,560
Meeting you
for the first time today...

63
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,240
has made me lose...

64
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,520
all my immunity.

65
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,880
Sorry.

66
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,840
May I ask, Mr. Yan,

67
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,240
does your airline...

68
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,840
have any plans to introduce
large domestic aircraft?

69
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,280
How large?

70
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,880
Why choose large domestic aircraft?

71
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,160
You can pick any foreign model.

72
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,440
Whichever one you want,

73
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:30,840
I'll get it for you.

74
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:32,920
Okay.

75
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,760
Mr. Yan,

76
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,200
drive safely.

77
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,160
Take it easy.

78
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,560
Ms. Ruan?

79
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,320
I just called you.

80
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,440
- You...
- Mr. Bai.

81
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,680
Here is your coffee.

82
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,960
Please enjoy.

83
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,680
I... You... How...
Mr. Bai,

84
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,960
long time no see.

85
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:14,960
I was just wondering...

86
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,359
if this Ruan Si Xian could be...

87
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,080
the same Ruan Si Xian who was
the former Flower of Hengshi.

88
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,880
It has been three years.

89
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,560
Your hair is shorter now.

90
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,879
But your aura is
still as outstanding as ever.

91
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:25,920
Did you get a new boss?

92
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,680
No, you didn't.

93
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,880
So Hengshi hasn't
gone bankrupt yet?

94
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,160
You guys must be working hard.

95
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,319
Look, Ruan Si Xian,
what happened three years ago...

96
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,400
No need to explain, Mr. Bai.

97
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,760
It's all in the past.

98
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,440
Are you...

99
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,720
free today?

100
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,560
I would like to have
a proper chat with you.

101
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,080
You came all the way
to our academy.

102
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,480
Did he send you?

103
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,920
- In a way, yes.
- I'm sorry, Mr. Bai.

104
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,880
If I had a list of airlines
I would consider signing with,

105
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,919
I'm not sure
who would be at the top.

106
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,200
But the one at the very bottom...

107
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,760
would definitely be Hengshi.

108
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,840
I have training to do.

109
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,040
I won't keep you.

110
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,320
Ruan... Ms. Ruan! I...

111
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:13,920
This had better be good news.

112
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,880
Well, it's sort of good news.

113
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,080
She is indeed...

114
00:07:18,081 --> 00:07:19,720
the fastest to graduate
among this batch of students.

115
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,600
All her evaluation scores
are exceptionally high.

116
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,679
In other words,
she's the top student this year.

117
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,960
I know all that.

118
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,760
Tell me, did she agree?

119
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:28,800
She hasn't agreed
to any airline yet.

120
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,240
But she...

121
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,960
She flat-out rejected Hengshi.

122
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,720
She flat-out rejected Hengshi?

123
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,880
Yes. She flat-out rejected Hengshi.

124
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,360
Whatever terms Yan An offered,

125
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,560
we can match them all.

126
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,720
We can even double them.
Have you told her that?

127
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,240
Mr. Fu, I've told her everything.

128
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,200
But the thing is...

129
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,639
It might have nothing to do
with the compensation.

130
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,240
It's about
Ruan Si Xian's personal wishes.

131
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,200
I'll talk to her directly.

132
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,640
Mr. Fu, hold on a second.

133
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,800
Xiao Ruan.

134
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,280
Could you come over for a moment?

135
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:02,000
Mr. Fu, hold on, she's coming.

136
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,400
Mr. Fu wants to talk to you.

137
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:09,840
Hello, I'm the vice president
of Hengshi Air, Fu Ming Yu.

138
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,000
Hello.

139
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,240
Hello.

140
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,680
I'll get straight to the point.

141
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,800
Hengshi is very sincere...

142
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,880
in inviting you
to join the Hengshi family.

143
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:20,000
If there's anything
you're unhappy with...

144
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:22,120
regarding Hengshi's conditions,

145
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,720
we can discuss it.

146
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:27,000
Bo'ao's catering tastes better.

147
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,600
That's simple.

148
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,280
If you have requirements
in that area,

149
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,399
I can have the head chef...

150
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:38,000
prepare your meals separately
before each flight.

151
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:39,800
That's so troublesome.

152
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:40,960
It's no trouble at all.

153
00:08:40,961 --> 00:08:42,280
Do you have any other requests,

154
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,960
Ruan...

155
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:45,400
Si Xian?

156
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:46,800
Ms. Ruan?

157
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:51,640
Nothing else, really.

158
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,680
I just feel that...

159
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,000
Mr. Yan has better character.

160
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,360
His smile is much friendlier.

161
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,720
We've never even met.

162
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,079
How could you know...

163
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,680
his character is better than mine...

164
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:05,080
or that his smile is friendlier?

165
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,800
Hello?

166
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,680
Did he hang up?

167
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,800
It seems he still doesn't
remember who I am.

168
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,360
Yeah.

169
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,600
Oh, right.

170
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:19,800
If you still want me
to consider joining Hengshi Air,

171
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,200
I'd like to ask you
to promise me one thing, Mr. Bai.

172
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,320
Xiao Ruan, please say it.

173
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:25,040
I'll agree to any condition.

174
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,240
If Mr. Fu doesn't remember who I am,

175
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,480
I hope you won't tell him.

176
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:31,400
Because I don't
want anything to do with him.

177
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,640
- Mr. Fu, go ahead.
- Where are you?

178
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,080
I was just about to head back.

179
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,040
Don't come back.

180
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,240
Wait for me at the aviation academy.

181
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,640
Tower, good afternoon.

182
00:09:49,641 --> 00:09:50,839
Bravo-12 Tango Juliet.

183
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,080
Ready, requesting taxi.

184
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:54,119
Bravo-12 Tango Juliet,

185
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,120
Tower, cleared to taxi.

186
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:57,520
Hold short of Runway 17 via A-A1.

187
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,920
Hold short of Runway 17 via A-A1.

188
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,320
Bravo-12 Tango Juliet.

189
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,640
Tower, Bravo-12 Tango Juliet.

190
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:07,960
Ready, requesting takeoff.

191
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,639
Bravo-12 Tango Juliet,

192
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,760
surface wind 170 at 2m/s.

193
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,040
Runway 17 is cleared for takeoff.

194
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:15,480
Runway 17 is cleared for takeoff.

195
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,800
Bravo-12 Tango Juliet.

196
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,480
Mr. Fu,

197
00:11:30,481 --> 00:11:32,440
are you sure you've reviewed
this person's profile?

198
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,840
I didn't just review it.

199
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,000
I've reviewed it many times.

200
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,320
Female pilots are already very rare.

201
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,880
Once she joins Hengshi,
Captain Fan Lei will train her...

202
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,400
to fly the domestic Z101.

203
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,840
I've also notified Zeng Yu...

204
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,840
to use her and the Z101...

205
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,080
as the core topic for promotion.

206
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,600
Mr. Fu, think about it.

207
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,200
Do you really have...

208
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:01,400
no memory of her at all?

209
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:02,920
She's so pretty,

210
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,920
with such an outstanding presence.

211
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,520
Mr. Bai.

212
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,200
Don't always judge people
by their looks.

213
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,240
Ruan Si Xian,

214
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:01,520
someone is here to see you.

215
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,360
Mr. Fu,

216
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,040
let me officially introduce you.

217
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,560
This is
the outstanding female pilot,

218
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,080
Ruan Si Xian.

219
00:13:23,081 --> 00:13:24,639
Xiao Ruan, this is...

220
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,040
There's no need to introduce Mr. Fu.

221
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,280
Who doesn't know him?

222
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:29,160
Hello, Ms. Ruan.

223
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,999
I've come here today
with Hengshi's greatest...

224
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,200
Mr. Bai has already told me.

225
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:35,560
It's a pity.

226
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,720
All this sincerity...

227
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:39,880
has likewise been expressed
by Mr. Yan from Bo'ao Airlines.

228
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:41,160
By comparison,

229
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,040
Mr. Yan seems...

230
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,720
a bit more sincere.

231
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:51,280
Then we can discuss other terms.

232
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,759
I can guarantee you...

233
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:53,919
at least 60 flight hours per month.

234
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,920
I'm sorry.

235
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,480
I still have training.
Please leave, Mr. Fu.

236
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,400
Is there some kind
of misunderstanding between us?

237
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,199
If Hengshi can offer you...

238
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,600
other opportunities and benefits,

239
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,960
Ms. Ruan, would you
be willing to listen?

240
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,120
Mr. Fu,

241
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,960
I don't think...

242
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:15,800
we've reached the point
where we can talk about benefits.

243
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,080
If not benefits,

244
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,840
then what?

245
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,200
Personal feelings?

246
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,520
I'm afraid
when it comes to feelings,

247
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,440
the airline I can
accept the least...

248
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,360
is Hengshi.

249
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,640
- Xiao Ruan.
- Ruan Si Xian!

250
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,720
What conditions
do I have to offer...

251
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,120
to make you change your mind?

252
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,440
Only if...

253
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:50,200
the sun rises from the west.

254
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,160
Ruan Si Xian!

255
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,480
You just said it yourself.

256
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,600
If the sun rises from the west,

257
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,120
you'll sign with Hengshi.

258
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:19,720
What did I say?

259
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,720
He's practically fuming.

260
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:33,599
Mr. Fu, I took another look...

261
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,840
at the information Mr. Wang gave us
on this year's student pilots.

262
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:38,000
Some of them have grades
that are quite outstanding.

263
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:39,160
No need.
I want her.

264
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,480
But Mr. Fu, do we have
to be so stubborn?

265
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:44,840
Right? The aviation academy has
many graduates every year.

266
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,240
Let's pick someone else.

267
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:48,400
It has to be her.

268
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,479
The Publicity Department is already
adjusting the Z101 promotion...

269
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,840
around her.

270
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:54,600
If we change the person,
the strategy won't work.

271
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:56,440
Then what should we do now?

272
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:58,400
Get to the airport
as fast as possible.

273
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:03,280
- Go to the General Airport.
- Three, two, one.

274
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,440
Cheese!

275
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,999
Ruan Ruan, you're so beautiful!

276
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,000
Stunning!

277
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:14,959
- Si Xian, let's take a photo.
- Sure.

278
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,280
- Let's take one together too.
- Okay, come on.

279
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,720
Okay. Cheese!

280
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,640
I want to take one too!

281
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,080
- Take one for me.
- I'll take one for you.

282
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:22,280
Come on.

283
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,080
Look at you, bringing flowers.

284
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,480
There, all done.

285
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,400
Thank you.

286
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,040
I'm glad you remembered
my graduation.

287
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,480
I rushed here as soon as I could,

288
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,360
but I still missed
your grand revenge plan.

289
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:40,280
Well? Did it feel good to vent?

290
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,600
It was okay.

291
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:45,080
It wasn't as satisfying
as I expected.

292
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:47,120
You're still not satisfied?

293
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,639
The fact that you got offered
double the relocation allowance...

294
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:49,760
is enough to make people envious.

295
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:51,920
Plus, you have a guaranteed
60 hours of flight pay every month.

296
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,160
Do you know what that means?

297
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:56,600
It means even if you
do nothing all month,

298
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:58,440
you'll earn more than I do
flying my tail off.

299
00:16:59,160 --> 00:17:01,040
As if I'd care
about such petty favors.

300
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,920
- You care.
- I care.

301
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,480
So what's the plan?

302
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,080
Are you going back to Hengshi...

303
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,200
to be my colleague again?

304
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,720
Would I eat my words so soon?

305
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,599
You're taking double
the relocation allowance...

306
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:18,840
and returning to Hengshi...

307
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:21,039
with the title of
their number one female pilot.

308
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,040
You're the one slapping their faces.

309
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,720
But when it comes down to it,

310
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:27,200
I'm just
a freshly graduated student pilot.

311
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:29,640
Isn't double
the relocation allowance...

312
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:31,160
a bit much?

313
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,240
Could it be a trap?

314
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,480
You're overthinking it.

315
00:17:35,481 --> 00:17:36,599
Fu Ming Yu is, after all,

316
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:37,840
the vice president of an airline.

317
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:39,400
Why would he use
double the relocation allowance...

318
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:40,520
just to mess with you?

319
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:43,039
Besides, on New Year's Eve,

320
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,280
who was the one shouting that...

321
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:47,040
within 5 years, she would
definitely fly the Z101?

322
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:50,440
Now that Hengshi is
finally introducing the Z101,

323
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:53,000
even we flight attendants
are all gearing up for it.

324
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,440
How can you stay so calm?

325
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,000
To be honest,

326
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:57,760
before I entered
the aviation academy,

327
00:17:58,280 --> 00:18:00,359
I never imagined
that I would love flying...

328
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,360
as much as I do today.

329
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,600
And I've studied
all the Boeing and Airbus models.

330
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:06,600
Compared to them, the Z101...

331
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,680
is more than
just technical innovation.

332
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:11,520
It represents our national pride.

333
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:13,920
For any pilot,

334
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,760
that's a huge temptation.

335
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,960
What's this, Ruan Si Xian?

336
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:24,280
Your heart has already
flown back to Hengshi.

337
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:26,319
It's even flown into the cockpit...

338
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:27,960
of their new aircraft model.

339
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:29,559
I just hope that...

340
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,199
when you sign the contract
with Fu Ming Yu,

341
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,320
you can play it a bit cooler.

342
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,880
As an old colleague,

343
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,280
welcome back to Hengshi.

344
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:37,719
You make it sound like I'll get...

345
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,280
to fly the Z101 as soon as I return.

346
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:42,880
Hengshi introducing a new aircraft
and me being able to fly it...

347
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,480
are two completely different things.

348
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:47,480
Usually, a new model wouldn't
be assigned to a rookie like me.

349
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:48,880
Why not?

350
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:51,080
Our "Captain" Ruan is the best.

351
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:15,200
Mr. Fu, are you okay?

352
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:28,120
I almost forgot.

353
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,920
You two still have that bad blood.

354
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,159
Only if the sun rises
from the west...

355
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,440
would you be willing
to return to Hengshi.

356
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,840
Ms. Ruan has her pride.

357
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:38,640
I only said that to mess with him.

358
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,160
However,

359
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:42,080
if he remembers me...

360
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:43,800
and apologizes sincerely,

361
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:48,400
I might reluctantly consider
your company.

362
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:51,119
Seriously, that Fu Ming Yu
could have messed with anyone,

363
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:52,560
but he had to mess
with "Captain" Ruan.

364
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:55,880
Anyway, the sun won't ever
rise from the west.

365
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:59,840
So do you want to go back or not?

366
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:15,040
We're here.

367
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:18,880
We're here.

368
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:32,840
Careful.

369
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,000
There's some turbulence.

370
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,920
Come on.

371
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:44,320
Here.

372
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:52,920
Who is it?

373
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,400
Bai Yang?

374
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,160
Ruan Si Xian,

375
00:20:58,560 --> 00:20:59,560
look.

376
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,480
The sun is rising from the west!

377
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,719
At dusk,

378
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,799
in high-latitude regions,

379
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,399
when flying from east to west,

380
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,519
if the flight speed...

381
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:10,039
is faster than
the sun's setting speed,

382
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:11,760
due to relative motion,

383
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:14,040
the sun will seem
to rise from the west!

384
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:22,280
Ruan Si Xian,

385
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,320
is my smile friendly enough now?

386
00:21:26,560 --> 00:21:27,880
The sun has risen from the west.

387
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:29,920
Will you join Hengshi Air now?

388
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:35,600
How could I forget about that?

389
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:38,160
The sun really can rise
from the west.

390
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:45,720
Ms. Ruan, please
look over the contract again.

391
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:47,600
If there's anything
you're unhappy with,

392
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,960
just let me know.

393
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:52,880
You're the same as ever, Mr. Fu.

394
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:54,560
When you want something done,

395
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,760
nothing in the world can stop you.

396
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,440
Right?

397
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,160
Ms. Ruan,

398
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:07,319
Mr. Fu and Hengshi Air...

399
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:08,840
have shown the utmost sincerity.

400
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:10,080
Double the relocation allowance...

401
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,560
and the latest pilot apartments.

402
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:13,079
Furthermore, Mr. Fu hopes that...

403
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:14,760
after joining Hengshi Air,
you can transition...

404
00:22:15,360 --> 00:22:18,200
to the new domestic aircraft model
that Hengshi is about to introduce,

405
00:22:18,520 --> 00:22:19,960
the Z101.

406
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:29,800
Why?

407
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,200
What do you mean, "why"?

408
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:32,879
I'm just a rookie...

409
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:33,880
who just graduated
from the aviation academy.

410
00:22:34,560 --> 00:22:36,600
Why would I get the chance
to transition to the Z101?

411
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:39,360
Hengshi has so many senior pilots.

412
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:41,240
For a major domestic aircraft,

413
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:43,159
shouldn't the most
outstanding pilots...

414
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,160
get priority for the transition?

415
00:22:44,560 --> 00:22:45,560
In my mind,

416
00:22:47,600 --> 00:22:48,760
you will become...

417
00:22:50,120 --> 00:22:51,800
Hengshi's most outstanding captain.

418
00:22:59,280 --> 00:23:00,360
Let me explain.

419
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:01,879
The inaugural flight
of Hengshi's Z101...

420
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,400
is set for 60 days from now.

421
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:06,240
So we welcome you
to join the Hengshi Air family.

422
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:12,959
Then our contract for today...

423
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,000
is officially signed.

424
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:15,560
We'll proceed
with the transfer process.

425
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:20,600
(Year 2017)

426
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,440
We welcome you...

427
00:23:36,360 --> 00:23:38,840
to join Hengshi Air's
first batch of pilots...

428
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:40,480
for the Z101.

429
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:27,039
(Bai Yang)

430
00:24:27,040 --> 00:24:28,040
Morning, Mr. Fu.

431
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:30,560
What time does the new plane arrive?

432
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:32,600
It's expected to arrive
at the airport at 6:40am.

433
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:08,079
Look! It's true!

434
00:25:08,080 --> 00:25:09,080
- It really is!
- Over there!

435
00:25:10,600 --> 00:25:12,480
Look! The plane is passing
through the water salute!

436
00:25:43,280 --> 00:25:44,400
So beautiful!

437
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:46,200
That is our country's own aircraft.

438
00:25:46,360 --> 00:25:47,360
Dad!

439
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:49,280
I'm talking about that lady.

440
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,960
She's really pretty.

441
00:25:52,080 --> 00:25:53,880
It's also my first time
seeing a female pilot.

442
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,760
Come on, Xiao Ruan.
Let me show you around.

443
00:26:40,840 --> 00:26:41,960
This is the lobby.

444
00:26:42,280 --> 00:26:43,760
The elevator goes straight
to your apartment.

445
00:26:44,280 --> 00:26:46,400
The fountain runs 24 hours a day.

446
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:47,480
It's even lit at night.

447
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,200
Mr. Fu hired...

448
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,639
a foreign designer...

449
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:51,920
to custom-build this facade.

450
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:54,400
It's high-end and elegant,
yet low-key.

451
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:57,480
I'll tell you a secret.

452
00:26:58,040 --> 00:26:59,040
Mr. Fu...

453
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,160
lives here too.

454
00:27:01,040 --> 00:27:02,040
Right above you.

455
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:03,560
Mr. Fu?

456
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:05,600
He lives above me?

457
00:27:05,960 --> 00:27:06,960
But he doesn't live here full-time.

458
00:27:07,360 --> 00:27:10,400
He only stays here for a night
when he's exhausted from work.

459
00:27:11,280 --> 00:27:12,280
Let's go.

460
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:15,920
Mr. Bai,

461
00:27:16,040 --> 00:27:17,440
you can leave me here.

462
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,840
I can go up by myself.

463
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:20,280
It's fine. I'll see you up.

464
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,560
Really, there's no need.

465
00:27:22,360 --> 00:27:23,360
I'll go up myself.

466
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:26,920
All right, in that case,
I'll give you...

467
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,400
the keycard to the apartment.

468
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:30,000
The passcode is your birthdate.

469
00:27:30,120 --> 00:27:31,440
You can change it anytime.

470
00:27:31,800 --> 00:27:33,080
If you need anything,

471
00:27:33,320 --> 00:27:34,320
feel free to contact me.

472
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:36,320
Mr. Bai.
Thanks for your help.

473
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,519
It's no trouble at all. All right.

474
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:40,720
Welcome to Hengshi Air.

475
00:27:42,120 --> 00:27:43,120
Good luck.

476
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:45,200
Thank you.

477
00:28:07,800 --> 00:28:08,960
Coming!

478
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:12,920
Quick, come in.

479
00:28:17,600 --> 00:28:18,600
Stunned?

480
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:20,040
Change your shoes.

481
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,200
Oh my gosh.

482
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:26,480
So this is your new home.

483
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:28,640
It's huge!

484
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,200
This...

485
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:33,920
There's even an ocean view!

486
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:37,480
This sofa...

487
00:28:37,560 --> 00:28:38,560
This color scheme...

488
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,720
It's so bouncy.

489
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:44,080
Oh my gosh.

490
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,760
You even have such a big kitchen.

491
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,319
Do you... Do you usually cook?

492
00:28:47,320 --> 00:28:48,320
Do you even know how?

493
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,599
Giving you such a big kitchen...

494
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:50,600
is a total waste.

495
00:28:52,760 --> 00:28:53,760
Ruan Ruan,

496
00:28:53,761 --> 00:28:55,960
can I take a peek at your bedroom?

497
00:28:56,600 --> 00:28:57,600
Go ahead.

498
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:04,960
This bed is so comfortable.

499
00:29:05,080 --> 00:29:07,080
It feels like it's over 2m wide.

500
00:29:07,320 --> 00:29:08,760
It's perfect for two people.

501
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:11,440
How much must this be worth?

502
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:16,400
What's wrong?

503
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:20,600
You actually...

504
00:29:21,040 --> 00:29:22,040
have a bathtub.

505
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:25,320
What's wrong with having a bathtub?

506
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,720
One's own failure is scary,

507
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:30,360
but a friend's success...

508
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,000
is even more heartbreaking.

509
00:29:32,600 --> 00:29:33,600
Fine.

510
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:35,160
If you want to stay here,

511
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:37,160
you can come over anytime.

512
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,440
Okay?

513
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:39,760
Really?

514
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:43,320
Then I'm going
to check out my study.

515
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:55,480
Doesn't Fu Ming Yu live upstairs?

516
00:29:57,040 --> 00:29:58,040
No wonder.

517
00:29:58,600 --> 00:29:59,600
Every time I see him,

518
00:29:59,601 --> 00:30:01,240
he seems so emotionally stable.

519
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:03,400
Living in such a nice place,

520
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:05,480
what kind of life troubles
could he possibly have?

521
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:11,800
Mr. Ruan, don't you worry.

522
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:13,880
Our Ruan Ruan is
living the good life now.

523
00:30:14,360 --> 00:30:15,840
She's a pilot now.

524
00:30:16,160 --> 00:30:17,200
Just look at this big apartment.

525
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:18,879
It's probably
a one-to-one replica...

526
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:20,200
of our boss's living standards.

527
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:23,120
Not quite.

528
00:30:23,320 --> 00:30:24,679
What do you mean, "not quite"?

529
00:30:24,680 --> 00:30:25,680
Is it that good?

530
00:30:26,360 --> 00:30:28,520
I think Fu Ming Yu is
being very sincere this time.

531
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:29,720
I heard Captain Yue Yang...

532
00:30:30,040 --> 00:30:31,040
lives on this floor too.

533
00:30:31,360 --> 00:30:33,199
The others all live
on the lower floors.

534
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,520
Some even have to share a room.

535
00:30:35,280 --> 00:30:36,280
What does that mean?

536
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,440
It means that to Hengshi Air,

537
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:39,559
you, Ruan Si Xian,

538
00:30:39,560 --> 00:30:40,920
are the most important trainee...

539
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:43,120
in the entire company.

540
00:30:43,640 --> 00:30:45,040
All right, have some water.

541
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,760
But I still feel...

542
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:50,640
like I've skipped too many levels.

543
00:30:51,840 --> 00:30:53,960
I don't feel comfortable
living in this apartment.

544
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:55,440
I'm just a rookie, after all.

545
00:30:56,080 --> 00:30:57,919
Could there be some kind of catch?

546
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:58,920
Look at you.

547
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,480
There goes
your imposter syndrome again.

548
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:01,680
Stop it right now.

549
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:02,999
If you didn't deserve this,

550
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:05,000
would Fu Ming Yu humble himself
to invite you to come back?

551
00:31:05,240 --> 00:31:06,560
He even chased the sun for you.

552
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:09,080
It's not that I don't trust myself.

553
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:11,400
I just don't trust Fu Ming Yu.

554
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,520
In just three short years,

555
00:31:15,080 --> 00:31:16,280
could his attitude
toward employees...

556
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:18,480
really do
a complete 180-degree turn?

557
00:31:18,840 --> 00:31:20,080
Why couldn't it?

558
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,880
You were the top student
at the academy.

559
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,200
In the future, you'll likely be...

560
00:31:23,201 --> 00:31:25,000
Hengshi Air's
number one captain.

561
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,280
You're no longer
that insignificant flight attendant.

562
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:28,360
Things are different now.

563
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:30,720
You're right.

564
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:33,200
I asked for too little.

565
00:31:33,320 --> 00:31:34,320
If I had known,

566
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:36,000
I would have pushed
for triple the relocation allowance.

567
00:31:36,600 --> 00:31:39,080
Consider it robbing "Fu"
to pay the poor.

568
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:41,120
Robbing "Fu" to pay the poor!

569
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:44,880
- Robbing "Fu" to pay the poor!
- Robbing "Fu" to pay the poor!

570
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,040
You're living the good life now.

571
00:31:54,520 --> 00:31:55,520
What brother-in-law?

572
00:32:04,880 --> 00:32:05,880
Tong Le!

573
00:32:05,881 --> 00:32:07,440
The delivery is here.
Go unload the goods.

574
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:14,559
(Fly Hub)

575
00:32:14,560 --> 00:32:15,879
I'll move these inside first.

576
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:17,439
You can unload the rest of the goods
from the truck.

577
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:18,520
You got it.

578
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:20,360
Thanks for the hard work, everyone.

579
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,480
It's our job, boss.

580
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:30,360
You've cleaned it so well.

581
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:33,440
Ms. Bian,

582
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:35,519
for us free laborers,

583
00:32:35,520 --> 00:32:36,840
haven't we been working...

584
00:32:37,280 --> 00:32:38,320
a bit too long?

585
00:32:38,760 --> 00:32:40,519
Are you tired
after just a little work?

586
00:32:40,520 --> 00:32:41,840
You need to work harder.

587
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:47,040
That's enough.

588
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:48,840
She's not even paying us.

589
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:51,640
Is this fair?

590
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,760
We really haven't worked that long.

591
00:32:54,800 --> 00:32:57,080
It's about balancing work and rest.

592
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:00,400
That's enough.

593
00:33:00,401 --> 00:33:02,000
Go upstairs
for some fresh air. Let's go.

594
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,200
Where are you going?

595
00:33:04,320 --> 00:33:06,480
The air is fresher
on the second floor.

596
00:33:08,040 --> 00:33:09,080
I'm exhausted.

597
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,480
Slow down.

598
00:33:11,200 --> 00:33:13,320
Xuan isn't here anyway.

599
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,000
Let's go.

600
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:22,640
The air outside is much better.

601
00:33:38,360 --> 00:33:40,080
Wipe your drool with that rag.

602
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:46,840
Where did Xuan find...

603
00:33:47,440 --> 00:33:48,720
such a handsome guy?

604
00:33:49,040 --> 00:33:51,200
She didn't have to look.

605
00:33:51,640 --> 00:33:53,040
He came right to her doorstep.

606
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:57,400
Xuan is something else.

607
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:59,600
She has someone
so good-looking here,

608
00:33:59,680 --> 00:34:01,200
but she didn't share him with us.

609
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:03,480
What's the use of sharing with you?

610
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:05,520
Don't you claim not
to believe in love?

611
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:09,600
That's because I haven't
met the right person...

612
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:11,960
in the past 26 years.

613
00:34:13,080 --> 00:34:14,160
You think he's the one?

614
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:15,480
Tong Le.

615
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,000
No, that's not right.

616
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:19,800
How can we "have fun together"?

617
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:21,880
Did you call me?

618
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:25,440
Is his name Tong Le?

619
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:27,000
What else would it be?

620
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:29,480
What were you thinking?

621
00:34:32,440 --> 00:34:33,440
Let me introduce you.

622
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:36,600
This is a young man I met
at a music festival.

623
00:34:37,680 --> 00:34:39,800
And these two are my besties.

624
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,280
Hello.

625
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,400
I'm Si Xiao Zhen.

626
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:44,880
Hello.

627
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:47,880
Hi, I'm Ruan Si Xian.

628
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:49,680
- Hello.
- Go on, get back to work.

629
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:50,960
Sure thing.

630
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:53,680
"Hello, I'm Si Xiao Zhen."

631
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:56,119
You're mocking me.

632
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,320
Look at her.

633
00:34:57,360 --> 00:34:58,880
Why are you using that cutesy voice?

634
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:02,039
Who said the wise don't
fall in love?

635
00:35:02,040 --> 00:35:03,520
And that only a fool would
change her mind?

636
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:05,199
You're the one who's a fool!

637
00:35:05,200 --> 00:35:06,440
I'm going to be mad
if you keep this up.

638
00:35:07,080 --> 00:35:08,280
I haven't even laughed at you yet.

639
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:10,640
You're the one going back
to your ex-boss.

640
00:35:12,200 --> 00:35:13,400
What about it?

641
00:35:13,960 --> 00:35:15,079
This "ex" I'm returning to...

642
00:35:15,080 --> 00:35:16,840
is premium quality.

643
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:18,559
I get double
the relocation allowance,

644
00:35:18,560 --> 00:35:19,840
and I get
to fly a domestic aircraft.

645
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:21,999
Well, in that case,

646
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:24,080
we definitely need a drink.

647
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,959
One is falling for a younger guy,

648
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,440
and the other is getting double pay.

649
00:35:27,520 --> 00:35:28,920
Working hard, aren't we?

650
00:35:30,680 --> 00:35:31,680
What about you?

651
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:32,960
Me?

652
00:35:33,160 --> 00:35:35,800
I have a nightlife every single day.

653
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:40,360
It's raining!

654
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:41,760
Tong Le!

655
00:35:41,840 --> 00:35:43,479
Hurry up and move the goods inside!

656
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,480
- Don't let them get wet!
- Okay!

657
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:45,880
Hurry!

658
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:48,920
It's pouring.

659
00:35:49,120 --> 00:35:50,120
It's so heavy.

660
00:36:28,120 --> 00:36:29,120
What are you looking at?

661
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:31,240
And what are you looking at?

662
00:36:31,600 --> 00:36:32,600
The rain.
Watching the rain.

663
00:36:34,240 --> 00:36:35,440
Then I'll watch the rain too.

664
00:36:35,560 --> 00:36:37,119
It's raining so hard!

665
00:36:37,120 --> 00:36:38,239
You're so annoying!

666
00:36:38,240 --> 00:36:40,000
Why are you like this?

667
00:37:01,240 --> 00:37:03,320
This morning, the airport expressway
was really congested.

668
00:37:03,640 --> 00:37:04,800
You had best leave early...

669
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,000
or take a detour.

670
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:08,080
Why don't we go together?

671
00:37:08,600 --> 00:37:09,960
I'm right here
at Mingchen Apartments.

672
00:37:10,880 --> 00:37:12,800
Mr. Bai, are you alone?

673
00:37:15,080 --> 00:37:16,080
Mr. Fu is here too.

674
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:20,400
Then it's not on the way.

675
00:37:25,720 --> 00:37:26,720
Mr. Fu,

676
00:37:26,721 --> 00:37:28,080
Ruan Si Xian might not be
at her apartment.

677
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:29,600
Why don't we leave first?

678
00:37:31,560 --> 00:37:32,600
What do you mean "might"?

679
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:44,600
Isn't that Ruan Si Xian?

680
00:37:47,720 --> 00:37:48,720
Drive.

681
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:01,880
(The driver has arrived
at the pick-up point.)

682
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:12,480
Sir, to Hengshi Air.

683
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:15,760
Sorry, this is the car I called.

684
00:38:16,080 --> 00:38:17,160
Please let me go first.

685
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:18,600
I'm in a hurry.

686
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,119
I have a meeting.
I'm about to be late.

687
00:38:20,120 --> 00:38:21,480
No. Get out.

688
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:28,520
Please wait a little longer, okay?

689
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:30,599
My meeting is really important.

690
00:38:30,600 --> 00:38:31,600
No.

691
00:38:31,640 --> 00:38:32,920
I have something very important too.

692
00:38:33,640 --> 00:38:35,760
Miss, I'm begging you.

693
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:37,240
Please help me out.

694
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:39,119
I had dinner
with a friend last night,

695
00:38:39,120 --> 00:38:40,120
had a few drinks,

696
00:38:40,600 --> 00:38:42,960
and overslept this morning.

697
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:45,640
Miss, this is a ride-hail car.

698
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:46,960
I can't take you.

699
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:48,040
Otherwise,
I'll be breaking the rules.

700
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:55,840
Sir, let's go.

701
00:39:08,680 --> 00:39:09,880
When you went
to the aviation academy,

702
00:39:11,120 --> 00:39:12,520
did you offend her?

703
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:25,840
When I went to the aviation academy,

704
00:39:27,040 --> 00:39:28,240
I offended her?

705
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:37,120
Send me her WeChat.

706
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,120
What are you waiting for?
Send it to me.

707
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:42,360
Understood.

708
00:39:43,720 --> 00:39:44,999
(Select Contacts, Ruan Si Xian,
Send to Mr. Fu)

709
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:47,920
(Mr. Fu)

710
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,800
What a coincidence.

711
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,880
You still made it in time.

712
00:41:14,200 --> 00:41:15,200
What a coincidence.

713
00:41:15,400 --> 00:41:16,400
You came to Hengshi Air too.

714
00:41:18,240 --> 00:41:19,240
I'm reporting to the HR Department.

715
00:41:26,800 --> 00:41:27,800
Did you just graduate?

716
00:41:34,240 --> 00:41:35,240
I knew it.

717
00:41:35,520 --> 00:41:37,320
Only an ignorant newbie
would act like that.

718
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:38,960
Have you started
your training flights?

719
00:41:40,200 --> 00:41:41,200
Not yet.

720
00:41:41,201 --> 00:41:43,240
Although things were unpleasant
at the apartment earlier,

721
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:45,880
I'm a generous person.

722
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:47,400
There are some things...

723
00:41:47,640 --> 00:41:49,040
I really have
to give you a few tips on.

724
00:41:49,200 --> 00:41:51,120
In our industry, seniority matters.

725
00:41:51,800 --> 00:41:53,360
When you start
your training flights,

726
00:41:54,040 --> 00:41:55,360
you had better keep your eyes open.

727
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:57,000
Be sensible.

728
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,320
Know when to yield.

729
00:41:58,600 --> 00:41:59,879
In places like elevators,

730
00:41:59,880 --> 00:42:00,880
it's one thing.

731
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:03,440
But if you also try to be the first
to board a plane,

732
00:42:04,080 --> 00:42:05,480
what will the purser think of you?

733
00:42:05,680 --> 00:42:07,720
If you're on one
of my flights for training,

734
00:42:08,600 --> 00:42:09,839
I will absolutely not allow...

735
00:42:09,840 --> 00:42:11,520
this kind of pushy behavior
to happen.

736
00:42:20,040 --> 00:42:21,040
What are you looking at?

737
00:42:26,120 --> 00:42:27,120
Forget it.

738
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,880
We'll inevitably
work together later.

739
00:42:29,560 --> 00:42:30,560
Let's introduce ourselves properly.

740
00:42:31,200 --> 00:42:32,200
Inflight Services, Division Four,

741
00:42:32,400 --> 00:42:33,400
Ni Tong.

742
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:38,160
Flight Operations, Sixth Squadron,

743
00:42:38,920 --> 00:42:40,320
Z101 Pilot,

744
00:42:40,880 --> 00:42:41,880
Ruan Si Xian.

745
00:42:44,240 --> 00:42:45,240
By the way,

746
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,480
if you're on one of my flights,

747
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:49,639
you had best not drink...

748
00:42:49,640 --> 00:42:50,680
within 24 hours
of reporting for duty.

749
00:42:51,160 --> 00:42:52,359
I absolutely do not allow...

750
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:53,360
flight attendants to be late.

751
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:58,520
Ruan Si Xian?

752
00:43:01,760 --> 00:43:02,920
Hello? Who is this?

753
00:43:03,040 --> 00:43:04,400
Ms. Ruan, it's me,

754
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:05,760
Yan An.
Mr. Yan.

755
00:43:06,760 --> 00:43:07,760
Is something the matter?

756
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:10,360
You were about to sign
a contract with us at Bo'ao.

757
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:12,280
Why did you go to Hengshi instead?

758
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:17,800
About Mr. Fu...

759
00:43:18,240 --> 00:43:19,240
Well,

760
00:43:19,600 --> 00:43:20,600
handsome,

761
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:22,120
dashing,

762
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:24,160
distinguished,

763
00:43:24,600 --> 00:43:25,760
refined,

764
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:27,720
imposing,

765
00:43:28,320 --> 00:43:29,720
suave,

766
00:43:29,840 --> 00:43:30,840
and free-spirited...

767
00:43:31,480 --> 00:43:32,480
are all things...

768
00:43:32,680 --> 00:43:33,720
that have nothing to do with him.

769
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:44,000
(Departing Ep. 2 for Ep. 3)
